---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Alignment.io — Nick Nikolaev" description="Engineering Lead bei Alignment.io — New York">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">

    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <img src="/assets/logos/alignment.png" alt="Alignment.io" class="h-10 w-auto" />
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">Alignment.io</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
      Engineering Lead
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
      <span>New York, USA</span>
      <span>2022 – 2024</span>
      <span>Arbeitssprache: Englisch</span>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      Alignment.io ist eine B2B-SaaS-Plattform, die Vertriebsteams dabei hilft,
      Kundengespräche zu analysieren und Deals schneller abzuschliessen.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Team</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Jim Benton · Gidon Wise</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Tech Stack</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">JavaScript</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Teamgrösse</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">5 Personen aufgebaut</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">

      <div class="flex justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-t-2xl border border-b-0 border-slate-200">
        <button class="js-star-btn flex-1 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-slate-900 border-b-2 border-[#0D9488]" data-step="0">Situation</button>
        <button class="js-star-btn flex-1 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-slate-500 border-b-2 border-transparent" data-step="1">Aufgabe</button>
        <button class="js-star-btn flex-1 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-slate-500 border-b-2 border-transparent" data-step="2">Aktion</button>
        <button class="js-star-btn flex-1 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors text-slate-500 border-b-2 border-transparent" data-step="3">Ergebnis</button>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">

        <div class="js-star-panel grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2" data-step="0">
          <img src="/assets/images/alignment-situation.png" alt="Situation" class="h-full min-h-[400px] w-full object-contain sm:border-r sm:border-slate-200" />
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:#0D9488">Situation</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Das Vertriebsteam hatte Schwierigkeiten neue Kunden einzuführen und die Alignment.io-Methodologie quartalweise zu verfolgen. Es war auch sehr schwierig die Nutzung unternehmensweit in einem Augenblick zu sehen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="js-star-panel hidden grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2" data-step="1">
          <img src="/assets/images/alignment-task.png" alt="Aufgabe" class="h-full min-h-[400px] w-full object-cover sm:border-r sm:border-slate-200" />
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:#0D9488">Aufgabe</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Dashboard arbeitsbereichweit von Figma-Design zu komplettem Feature bauen.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="js-star-panel hidden grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2" data-step="2">
          <img src="/assets/images/alignment-aktion.png" alt="Aktion" class="h-full min-h-[400px] w-full object-cover sm:border-r sm:border-slate-200" />
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:#0D9488">Aktion</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Meeting mit Gidon um das Backend zu entwickeln → Projekt in Alignment erstellt → V1 bereit für QA → QA + Deploy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="js-star-panel hidden grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2" data-step="3">
          <img src="/assets/images/alignment-ergebnis.png" alt="Ergebnis" class="h-full min-h-[400px] w-full object-cover sm:border-r sm:border-slate-200" />
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:#0D9488">Ergebnis</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Verdopplung der Onboarding-Effizienz</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
  <script src="../../scripts/alignment.js"></script>
</Base>